{"ref":"BDB, חֲשֵׁכָה","hw":"חֲשֵׁכָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲשֵׁכָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. darkness</strong> (chiefly poet.)—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:12\" href=\"/Genesis.15.12\">Gn 15:12</a> + 2 times, so read also prob. <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:6\" href=\"/Micah.3.6\">Mi 3:6</a> (for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">חָֽשְׁכָה</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲשֵׁיכָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:12\" href=\"/Psalms.139.12\">ψ 139:12</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶשְׁכַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:12\" href=\"/Psalms.18.12\">ψ 18:12</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲשֵׁכִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.10\">Is 50:10</a>;—<em>darkness</em>, opp. light <span dir=\"rtl\">(אוֹרָה)</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:12\" href=\"/Psalms.139.12\">ψ 139:12</a>; supernat., <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ גדולה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:12\" href=\"/Genesis.15.12\">Gn 15:12</a> (JE); <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶשְׁכַּת־מַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:12\" href=\"/Psalms.18.12\">ψ 18:12</a> in theoph. (but ‖ <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.12\">2 S 22:12</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">חַשְׁרַת־מים</span> <em>a mass of water</em>); fig. = lack of understanding <a data-ref=\"Psalms 82:5\" href=\"/Psalms.82.5\">ψ 82:5</a>; = distress <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.22\">Is 8:22</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צָרָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.10\">50:10</a>.","next":"BDB, מַחְשָׁךְ","prev":"BDB, חָשֹׁךְ"}